Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Price on Request","content":"Lodha Malabar is registered under the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority (MahaRERA) with registration number P51900034949, P51900055626 The registration enables prospective buyers to verify official project information before proceeding with a purchase.\n\nThe MahaRERA registration provides access to important project-related information, including:\n\nApproved project plans\n\nConstruction progress\n\nPossession timeline\n\nStatutory approvals\n\nDeveloper disclosures\n\nRegulatory compliance\n\nReviewing these records allows buyers to independently verify project details while ensuring greater transparency throughout the home-buying process.\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n2 Sales Transactions Registered in Lodha Malabar From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 1.1 L/Sq.Ft. [...] #### 5. Limited Collection of Sea-Facing Residences\n\nSet on one of the largest land parcels in Malabar Hill, Lodha Malabar offers expansive residences with uninterrupted views of the Arabian Sea and surrounding greenery, creating a level of exclusivity that is increasingly rare in South Mumbai\n\n## Lodha Malabar Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Lodha Malabar.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\ | Action |\n --- \n| 4 BHK Apartment  3843 Sq. Ft. | Price on Request | Get Payment Plan |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  4643 Sq. Ft. | Price on Request | Get Payment Plan |\n| 5 BHK Apartment  6271 Sq. Ft. | Price on Request | Get Payment Plan |\n\n\\Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends [...] 2, 3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.58 Cr to 10.06 Cr\n\nLodha Woods residential project in Kandivali East\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.17 Cr to 6.44 Cr\n\nLodha The Park residential project in Worli\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment, Office Space, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 6.00 Cr to 15.57 Cr\n\nLodha Eternis